        "answer": {
          "text": "According to the historian, the legend of the cave is very old. The cave is said to have been a meeting place for the villagers. Some villagers claim that they hear music there at night, and one woman insisted that she had seen a light. I asked whether there was any evidence, and the historian said that there was none. The only source is a local newspaper, so the story remains a legend.",
